<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Argentine consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's February consumer price inflation by sector was as follows, according to a report released Tuesday by the Economy Ministry:</p>
<p>    Food					  0.2 percent</p>
<p>    Clothing				   -0.7 percent</p>
<p>    Housing				     0.7 percent</p>
<p>    Household goods			  -0.1 percent</p>
<p>    Health					0.0 percent</p>
<p>    Transport and communications	  3.6 percent</p>
<p>    Entertainment			    -0.3 percent</p>
<p>    Education				   0.0 percent</p>
<p>    Others					0.0 percent</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0652))</p>
</text>
